<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">K'olasiyas</para>
  <para style="toc2">K'olasiyas</para>
  <para style="toc1">K'olasiyas Maants</para>
  <para style="toc3">K'ol.</para>
  <para style="mt3">Wosheetso P'awlos Wosho</para>
  <para style="mt">K'olasiyas Ashuwots Maants</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshan b́ guut'e múk'ú Isiyotse Ephesoniyere aawkesho maantse daatseyiru K'olasiyas kittutsi Ik'i moowushe. Ik'i maa man bneed' P'awlosn woto b́k'azalor Rom shirotse keweetsu Isiyi kitt een wottsu Ephesonitse doo shishiyosh woshetswotsi b́ woshefotse K'olasiyastsnowere alo detsfe b́teshi. K'olasiyas Ik'i mooshowere biatse alo detsefe b́tesh, K'olasiyas Ik'i mootse «Ik'o danonat s'een beyo daatsosh asho ik ikon shayiri angwotsnat naashwotssh sagado geyituwe» etiru kootets danifwots bo beyok'o P'awlos shishre b́tesh, daniifihanoots boetirwo k'osh keewo «Asho ik ikon gof amook'o wotts nemwotssh keeweyarr mishonat k'osh niwuwotsi koto bín geyife» etka b́tesh.</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awlos woshan b́ guut' arik wotsts krstiyani dano t'intson bo kooti dano k'efosha btesh, b́ t'intsts aniwwotsitsere eeno «Iyesus Krstos s'een wotts beyo imetwe, k'osh imnetiyotsnat k'aleyirwotsnmó bíyatsne asho bowokiyiti» etiruwoniye, Ik'o Krstosn datso b́ azii, b́ weeronowere b́ maantsan aani de'er b́ weeti, datsu kashi jango b́ detset Krstosi nibon amanon mec'rone, han jangosh P'awlos een danan amantsuwots beyon aawk'on sháánr b́be'etwok'niye b́ kitsiri.</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshan P'awlosoke dek't K'olassiyas maants betsosh wosheetso Tikik'osnton beyirwo Onesimosi b́ wottsok'o s'iilo shenge, mansh P'awlos Onesimosi eteetso guutso jango tuzt Filmonsh k'osh wosho guut're.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo 1:1-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstos doyonat finon 1:9—2:19</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstosn handr beyo 2:20—4:6</para>
  <para style="io1">Gúúpo 4:7-18</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Ik' shunon Krstos Iyesush wosheets wottso P'awlosn at no eshu T'imotiyosoke.<verse eid="COL 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>K'olasayasn beyiru Krstosn S'ayinonat amanek wotts amantsuwotssh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Ik'o no nihokere deeronat jeenon itsh wotowe.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos Údo K'olasiyas Ashuwotssh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>It jangosh Ik'o t k'onor nodoonz Iyesus Krstos nih Ik'o úni aawo údirwone. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Krstos Iyesusn it detsts imnetiyonat amants jamwotssh it detsts shuno shishrone. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Ari aap' wottso doo shishiyo shin shino itok b́bodor bítse fa'a jangeyirwo shishirute, mansh it imnetiyonat it shunon b́need' darotse k'aniyere itn kotirwo jangiyetsmanatsne. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Dooshishiyan dats jamatse shwonat eenoke b́fa'oni mank'o it doo shishyo itk'ebiyakonat Ik'i s'aato arik b́wottsok'owo t'iwints itdek'iyak aawotstson it dagots finoke b́faoni. <verse eid="COL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="COL 4:12">K'ol. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Film. 23</ref> </char></note> Hanowere no shegro Krstos guuts amanetso wottsonat noontonuwere towaat finirwo shuneetso Ep'afray itsh keewre. <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>Mank'owere Ik'i Shayiron it atsatseyo it shunewo bí noosh keewre.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Mansh han noshishts aawotstson tuwat Shayiri dani teleefon t'iwints jamo Ik'i shunon t'iwints itdek'etu s'eents dano it detsetwok'o itsh Ik' k'ono ned'iratsone. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Mank'owere doonzosh wotts weeron beyarr b́ jamon bín it gene'ushitwok'o kon naari sheeng fino finon shuwo it shwitwok'onat Ik' danon eenfere it ametuwok'o Ik'o k'onituwe. <verse eid="COL 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Doonzo aydek' een wotts b́ kup'on itsh ang jamo ime, k'amoon jam keewo falon k'andek'tswotsi it wotitwok'o itn woshwe, <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>dabnuere shááni mengstutse S'ayinwotsnton rstiyo it kayitwok'o itn betsts Ik'o niho gene'on údooere. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>Bíwere t'alwi angotse noon kashit shuneets naayo mengstots no kinditwok'o woshre. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe. 1:7</ref> </char></note> Bíínowere noo aaniyi keeweyat no morrosh orowe eto daatsrone.<verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstos azeets jamoniyere damb b́wottsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Krstos be'eraw Ik'osh bíariyoniye. Bí azeets jamoniyere k'aabe. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Daronat datsatse fa'awots, be'eyirwonat be'eraw, daratsi angwotsnat keewirwotsno, naashwotsnat aliru jamwots bo azee bíne. Ik'o jam keewo bí az bín bíshe. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Bí jam keewoniyere shine b́ teshi, jam keewo desheyat b́ need' bíne. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe. 1:22-23</ref> </char></note> Bí bí ats wotts Ik' moosh b tooke, jam keewon shntso b́ wotitwok'o, k'irotse tuwon shintsonat k'aaboniye. <verse eid="COL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Han b́wotwere Ik'o Ik' b́woti s'eeno b́ naayn b́wotish Ik'o niho shuntso b́wottsotsne. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe. 2:16</ref> </char></note> Bínowere daron wotowa datsatse fa'a keewu jamwotsi b́ tookonton maniyo shunre, jitatse kud'ts b́naay s'atson jeeno b́woshi.<verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Shin Ik'atse wokaatni it beefoni, it asaabiyona it gond finatse tuutson balangarwotsiye it teshi. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Andmó S'ayinwotsnat eegonor s'amiyerawotsi, boatse eeg eeg daatserawotsi woshdek't b́shinats itn t'intsosh, b́ naay meetson b́ k'irtsosh, Ik'o b́tookonton itin b́ maniyi. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Han b́ wotitwere bíyats need'dek'at matseyat bíko dooshishiyatse daatsosh jangiyets keewatse it giwrawo amanon kup'arr it beewor s'uziye, dooshishiyanwere it it shishtsonat datsatsere fa'a ashuwotssh nabetsoniye, taa P'awlos guutso twot dooshishiyanshe.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">P'awlos woshetsi fino</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>And it jangatse tdek'iru gond bek'osh geneeúwirwe, bíats wotts Ik'i moowshowere Krstos gondbek'o kaydek'oonton taash shapitwo tmeetson s'eentsitwe. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Ik'i aap'o s'eenon itsh kitsosh Ik'oke taash imets alok'oon Ik'i moosh fintso wotere. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Ik'i aap'onwere beshts dúron shweets ash na'úwotssh ááshat teshtsonat andmó Ik'o bík S'ayinwotts jamwotssh b́kiitsts ááshat teshtsoniye. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Ik'onwere bík S'ayinwotssh kitsosh b́geeyir hanoke fa'o ááshts mangi gaalo ititse Ik'i ashwoterawwots dagotse awuk'o bodts een b́wottsok'oniye, ááshtsanwere jangat nokotiru mang bín datsetu Krstos ititse b́ wotoniye. <verse eid="COL 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Asho ik ikon Krstosn bodtso b́wotitwok'o kaldek'at t'intsosh ash jamosh dani teleef jamon daniyat izon Krstos jango nabirwone. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Ik'o bíeen angon tgitsotse b́ finirwotse angaann no keewtsán b́finetwok'o kup'dek'at maak'orefetsat shaatsirwe.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>It jangonat Lodok'itse fa'a ashuwots aaninwere t shiitso dab be'e danaw ash jamwotssh awuk'o bodts kup'ts kaaro t kariruwok'o itdanetwok'o shunfee. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Mank'o tk'alirwere it nibo kup'de'er shunon desheyarr, s'eents t'iwints jamo oorshde'er Ik'oko ááshts keewo wottso Krstosi bodanetwok'owe. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>Dani teleefonat dani gaalon ááshat b́fa'o Krstosoke.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Itsh han tietirwere konwor itn kooton b́dashrawok'owa etaatniye, <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Dab meetson it atse twokiyalor Shayiron itntoniye, sheeng niwon itbeyiruwok'on Krstosatse it detsts kup'ts imnetiyo bek'onowere geneúwiruwone.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Krstosn aatset s'enwotts beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Doonzo Krstos Iyesusi it dek'tsok'on bín beewere,, <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>Bíyats s'ap'arr ageyarr, dan itdek'tsok'on imnetiyon kup'ar beewere,, s'eenr orit údo t'intswere.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Krstosats need'iyek b́woterawo datsanatsi daneets niwwats, k'awntsal kooton konworu itn deshb́de'awok'o it tooko korde'ere. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Ik'o Ik' b́woti s'eeno atson be'eyat b́beyir s'eenon Krstosne.<verse eid="COL 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Itwere s'een kasho it daats alguronat aljami took wottso Krstosne.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Bín it amantsosh gofo amrte, it gof amanwere morrets it meets doyo baziyosh Krstosn fiineka bako ash kishon fiinekaliye. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rom 6:4</ref> </char></note> It gupewor Krstosntoniye itdukeyi, bíntonowere k'irotse turte, k'irotse it tuwwere Krstosi k'irotse tuzts Ik'o angon it amantsotsne. <verse eid="COL 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe. 2:1-5</ref> </char></note> Morro itfintsonat itmeetsi doyo gof am b́k'aztsatse tuutson k'irkitne it teshi, andmó Ik'o Krstosnton k'irrawwotsi iti woshre, no morr únoshowere oorowe etre. <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>Bí noon k'efefetst noon s'aamifets teshets nemotse fa'a k'awntso guut'etso t'afibazre, jitats mismaron togdek't noatse k'aaúbazre. <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Kup'uwotsnat aletswotsn jitatse da'at bo edo b́ bítsiyakon da'etsuwotsi wotar sháánatse bo be'etuwok'o b́ woshi.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rom 14:1-6</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe móón wee ushon, Ik' aawu koton wee shaash taawur koton, wee sanbati aawu mangiy jangon konuworu itats angshk'aye. <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Jamanots shino maants weet keewwotssh c'ishok'one, aronmo b́ daatset Krstosne. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Woteraw b́ took dash detson melakiwtsi ik'iyon bogtaana etiru asho konworu k'awntsalo itn b́ orirawok'o it atso korde'ere, hank'o ashaan b́ bek'iru bek'osh kááwu taana eton woteraw meetsi asaabiyone b́ it'iri. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe. 4:16</ref> </char></note> Hank'o ashaan took wottso Krstosnton eegonoru gonkewo falratse, ats jamo gonkidek't shas'on deshit manzirwo tooke. Ik'o ats jamo b́ ditsir hank'one.<verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sheelts danatsere ats kordek'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Krstosnton k'irr datsanatsi daneets niwwotsatse b́ jamon galek it wotiyakon beré and datsanatse it galeraawok'o wotat eegishe hank'o tzaziyosh it keeweyir, <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>tzaziyotswere «Detsk'aye, fadk'aye, t'awik'aye» etirwotsiye. <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Jamanots ash fints tzaziyonat danatse tuutson b́ wottsosh finats bojiniyakon t'afosh k'andek'́kne. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Tzaziyanots bo took shunotse t'úp'keshts ik'iyonat woteraw b́ took dash detso, ats juwats b́ bogshituwotse dan telefetswotsiye boariri, ernmó bo meets tewuno kórdek'atse k'awntso deshawwotsiye.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Krstosn handr beyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Dub. 110:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Krstosnton k'irotse it tuwiyakon eshe Krstos Ik'o k'ani aaromantse b́beeyirwoke dambe fa'a keewwotsi geyore. <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Uni aawo dambe fa'a keewwotsi gawwore bako datsatse fa'a keewwots jangosh shiyank'ayere. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>It k'iron k'alewok'ó k'alewon datsanatse k'alewtserte, it beyonwere Krstosnton Ik'ots aashwtsere. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>It kash wottso Krstos b́be'ewor itwere bínton mangon be'etute.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Natona bandr beyon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Eshe mansh it gitsotse datsatsi beyi tewun jamo ud'uwere, boowere «Widona, kiimo, gusiyo, gond tewuno, Woteraw ik'uwotsi ik'iyok'o wotts tewno» manootsiye. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Keewanotsatse tuutson aleraw ashuwotsats Ik'i fayo weetuwe. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>It woor haniyere shin it beyor keewanotsi finefetsatniye it teshi.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Andmó fayo, nibk'úno, nemigondo, ash shúts t'afiyo, itatse wokiwere, jitsit keewonwere it nonotse keshk'aye. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe. 4:22</ref> </char></note> Natts doyo b́fiinonton kishde'k'at juu it k'rtsotse itatsatseyo kooto keewek'ayere. <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aze. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe. 4:24</ref> </char></note> Aztso aro aron dano daatsosh andrefere ameetwo handr doyo tahdek'rtee. <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Hank'on Girik ashonat Ayhudi ashon, gof amtsonat gof amawon, ash dats ashwotowa, salat'ank wotowa salat'anera ash wotowa, guutsonat guutswoteraw ash dagotse k'osh k'oshewo aaliye, Krstos jamoniye, jamotsnowere bíne.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:12-13 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe. 4:2</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshe Ik'o galb́dek'tsanotsnat S'ayin shunetswots it wottsosh maac'k'ewo, doo, b́took dashan detso, t'at'deshawo, k'amo tahde'ere. <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe. 4:32</ref> </char></note> It atsa atsewo k'amewere, ititsere iko ikats b́ iirits keewo fa'e wotiyal orowa erere, Krstos itsh orowa b́ ettsok'o itwere orowa erere. <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Jamánatsere bogshde'er jamo ikok koide tifde'er b́ jamon ik wot daatsit shuno tahde'ere. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Ik atsikaywotsi wotat arikon s'eegetswots jeen wotts Krstosko jeeno itnibats naashowe, bín údirwotsnowere wotoore. <verse eid="COL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Krstos aap'tso ititse s'eenon it nibots beewe, dani teleef jamonowere it atsatsewo daniwere, shiyewere, duubonat údi dubonowere, Shayiri jááwi dubonowere it nibotse Ik'o údfetsr duuwere. <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efe. 5:19-20</ref> </char></note> Iyesus weeron Ik'o niho údfetsr it keewirwonowere it k'aliru jamo doonzo shútson k'aluwere, bínowere Ik'o niho údoore.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe. 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 P'et'. 3:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Máátsuwotso! doonzo shinatse sheeng b́wottsotse it kenihsh alewere.<verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:5">Efe. 5:5</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 P'et'. 3:7</ref> </char>
    </note> Kenihuwotso! it máátswotsi shunere, boosh maac' kup'wotsi wotk'ayere.<verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe. 6:1</ref> </char>
    </note> Nana'uwotso! han doonzo geneúshitk b́wottsotse jamkeewon it ind nihosh alewere.<verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe. 6:4</ref> </char>
    </note> Nihwotso! bo maac'o bok'ut'rawok'o it nana'o fayon nibo k'únik'ayere.<verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe. 6:5-8</ref> </char>
    </note> Guuts guutsuwotso! datsatsi it doonzotssh jamkeewon alewere, it aletwere bo iti bobek'iruwonat ash maac'o k'eezon be'ewosh b́woterawon doonzo shatonat nib s'ayinon wotowe. <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>It k'aliru jamo ashosh b́woterawon doonzo Iyesussh it k'aliruwok'o it nibon k'aluwere. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Hanshowere doonzo dari ristiyo k'awnts woshde'er itsh b́imetwok'o danfte, bísh itfinirwonwere doonzo Krstosiye, <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Iwi. 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe. 6:9</ref> </char></note> Ik'oke bogabogsho bíaaltsotse gond finitwonwere b́gondfinosh fayo dek'etwe.<verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe. 6:9</ref> </char>
    </note> Doonzwotso! itwere daaratse doonzo it detstsok'o danr it guutswotsi kááwonat taalon boon k'eezwere.<verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Dabeets izo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Kup'ar Ik' údon it k'ut'rawo Ik'o k'onuwere, <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>hantonwere Ik'o b́ aap'osh fengesho noosh b́ k'eshitwok'onat taawere b́ jangosh tipeyat t beyirwo Krstosk ááshtso keewo keewosh no falituwok' nooshowere Ik'o k'onwere. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Taawere shengshde'er b́ aap'o kishde'er t keewituwok'o taash Ik'o k'onuwere.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe. 5:16</ref> </char>
    </note> Dúro kewude'fetsr amaneraw ashuwotsoke dani teleefon beewere. <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Ik ik ashosh wotit keewo aaniyosh it falituwok'o jam aawo it keewo nefonat aamb shaawon wotowe.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">S'uwaatsi jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Wosh. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 T'im. 4:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Tikik'os t jangosh jam keewo itsh keewituwe, bíhe shuneets eshwe, amanek guutsonat doonzo finoshowere taanton fini toohe. <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe. 6:21-22</ref> </char></note> Bín itok twoshwere t jangosh itsh b́ keewituwok'onat it nibo b́ kup'shishe. <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Film. 10-12</ref> </char></note> Bínton it jir wottso amanetsonat shuneets eshwo Onesimos it maants weetwe, boowere hanoke fa'a keewu jamo itsh daniitwne.<verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="ACT 19:29">Wosh. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Wosh. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref> </char>
    </note> Taanton tipetso Arst'rokoswere jamo itsh t'intsirwe, iknoto, «Itok b́ woor it dek'etwok'owa» etaat itsh gawiyat t teshtso Barnabasiy naayi Mark'oswere jamo itsh t'intsirwe. <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Iyost'osi ett s'egeyirwo Iyasu jamo itsh t'intsitwe, Ik' mengst jangosh taanton tohaat finiru ashuwotsitse ayhudiwotsitse amantsanots s'uziye taan kup'iyri.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="COL 1:7">K'ol. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Film. 23</ref> </char>
    </note> It jir wottso Iyesus Krstos guutso Ep'afrawwere jamo itsh t'intsirwe, shayiri beyon eenr kup'ar it ned'itwok'onat Ik' shunonowere jamon it s'eentsitwok'o bí itsh jam aawo Ik'o k'onirwe. <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>It jangosh Lodok'iyonat Hirapolis kittwotsitse fa'a ashuwotssh ayidek't b́ mawirwok'osh taa t tookon gawu taane. <verse eid="COL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 T'im. 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Film. 24</ref> </char></note> Shuneets hakimiyo Luk'asnat Demasn jamo itsh t'intsirune. <verse eid="COL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Lodok'iyon fa'a eeshuwotsna Nimfnnat b meyitse fa'a Ik' moowushowere jamo t'intsuwere. <verse eid="COL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Woshani it nababiyakon Lodok'iy ashuwotsoke fa'a Ik' mootse b nababeetuwok'o woshuwere, itwere Lodok'iyon itsh woshet wosho nababoore. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Film. 2</ref> </char></note> Arkip'asshowere «Doonzo finosh neesh imets fino sheengshde'er n s'eentsitwok'o» err keewuwere.<verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>S'uwaatsi jaman t kishon guut' taane P'awlosiye, Habiliyon tipeyat t beyiruwok'o gawwere.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Ik' s'aato itnton wotowe.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
